    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "If you are looking to build your dream home in a private coastal setting between Malahide and Portmarnock then look no further than this superb site at Monks Meadow. Ready to go, with full planning permission in place for a contemporary detached high quality family home (planning reference number F24A / 1152E). The planning permission is for a 5 bedroom detached property measuring an impressive 351 square metres / 3,776 square feet including the attached garage (Garage 32 square metres / 344 square feet). The site measures over 0.3 of an acre and is accessed through a private road off The Coast Road. This wonderful site combines a stunning coastal location and is set in amongst private gardens. Superbly positioned between Malahide and Portmarnock with its fabulous coastal walks, the site is within easy access of all local amenities including shops, schools and commuter transport links. Viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
